# Angular component discipline

Match the repository's standalone vs NgModule style. Do not convert a feature to
standalone (or the reverse) in-task unless that is the requested change.

Reuse the existing state pattern (services, NgRx, signals, or component state).
Do not add a new state library.

Unsubscribe from RxJS in new subscriptions: prefer `takeUntilDestroyed` or the
project's established teardown helper. Do not leave open subscriptions on
destroyed components.
